  "details": "In the latest open beta, the size of the interact collider can be scaled wrong. In my case it has doubled it's size. The root game object of the \"Guardian Tiger\" is scaled to 0.5. It seems that the collider on the \"ChatBotTrigger\" child does something like 1/0.5 internally, which causes the double size. Screenshots are live vs. open beta.",
